/* Somnus · Strata Harbor: a theme for T3 Code, from github.com/mako-code/t3code-themes
   Make it yours: --sx-glow-k is how strongly lit things glow (0 none, .5 soft, 1 bright), --sx-rim-o the trail
   round the chat bar (0 off), --sx-r-* the corners. Colours, backdrop, motion and more: the Studio in that repository. */
